option.EXPOSURE=Exposure (stops)
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.TEMPERATURE=Temperature
option.TINT=Tint
option.GRAYSCALE=Grayscale
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Brightness in stops. Zero leaves the scene unchanged.
option.SATURATION.comment=One is neutral. Zero removes color.
option.CONTRAST.comment=One is neutral. Adjusts contrast around mid-gray.
option.TEMPERATURE.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative is cooler; positive is warmer.
option.TINT.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative adds green; positive adds magenta.
option.GRAYSCALE.comment=Optional weighted grayscale after other color controls.

option.DEBUG_VIEW=Debug View
option.DEBUG_VIEW.comment=Raw surface buffers bypass color grading. Black means no recorded surface.
value.DEBUG_VIEW.0=Normal Rendering
value.DEBUG_VIEW.1=View-space Normals
value.DEBUG_VIEW.2=Lightmap: Red Block / Green Sky
value.DEBUG_VIEW.3=Directional NdotL
option.LIGHTING_STRENGTH=Directional Lighting Strength
option.LIGHTING_STRENGTH.comment=Zero restores Milestone 1 scene lighting.
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT=Ambient Factor
option.AMBIENT_LIGHT.comment=Lighting floor for sky-exposed surfaces. Caves retain original lightmap lighting.
option.DIRECT_LIGHT=Direct Light Factor
option.DIRECT_LIGHT.comment=Strength of the Lambert term; no shadows are calculated.
